WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:03,210
Lihim? Anong sikreto?

2
00:00:03,210 --> 00:00:06,100
Bakit alam ng lahat sa Bai Yuxing?

3
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:08,867
Alu

4
00:00:08,867 --> 00:00:18,550
Saan kayo pupunta?

5
00:00:18,550 --> 00:00:26,220
Okay lang, sikreto mo sa kanya ng ganito

6
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:27,620
Paano niya nakilala si Alu?

7
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:29,100
Hindi, si Alu ang tinutukoy niya

8
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:30,500
Sinabi ni Lu na hindi niya naiintindihan

9
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:32,420
Pero hindi ko maipaliwanag kung sino si Alu

10
00:00:32,420 --> 00:00:33,500
Utang ko yan

11
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:41,330
Mr. Shen, lagi kong naaalala

12
00:00:41,330 --> 00:00:43,970
Old version lang ako ng number 926

13
00:00:43,970 --> 00:00:45,910
wala
